## Hunt Methodology

### Stage 1 — Authentication Baseline

Establish normal successful authentication activity.

```spl
index=* EventCode=4624
| stats count by host
| sort - count
```

### Stage 2 — Network Authentication

Identify successful network logons with remote source information.

```spl
index=* EventCode=4624 LogonType=3
| where IpAddress!="-" AND IpAddress!="127.0.0.1" AND IpAddress!="::1"
| sort _time
| table _time host TargetUserName IpAddress WorkstationName LogonType
```

### Stage 3 — Authentication Sequence Analysis

Review failures and successes chronologically.

```spl
index=* (EventCode=4624 OR EventCode=4625)
| eval auth_result=if(EventCode=4625,"FAILURE","SUCCESS")
| sort _time
| table _time host TargetUserName IpAddress LogonType auth_result
```

### Stage 4 — PowerShell Hunt

Search for PowerShell characteristics that warrant analyst review.

```spl
index=* EventCode=4104
("EncodedCommand" OR "FromBase64String" OR "Invoke-" OR "DownloadString" OR "Hidden")
| sort _time
| table _time host Message
```

### Stage 5 — Persistence Hunt

```spl
index=* EventCode=4698
| sort _time
| table _time host SubjectUserName TaskName
```

Alternate search:

```spl
index=* ("schtasks.exe" OR "Register-ScheduledTask")
| sort _time
| table _time host _raw
```

### Stage 6 — Privilege Modification Hunt

```spl
index=* EventCode=4728
| sort _time
| table _time host SubjectUserName MemberName GroupName
```

