```

### PowerShell Activity

The following controlled PowerShell activity was generated on WIN11-02:

```powershell
$cmd='Write-Output "Sprint28 HUNT001 Test"'
```

```powershell
$encoded=[Convert]::ToBase64String([Text.Encoding]::Unicode.GetBytes($cmd))
```

```powershell
powershell.exe -EncodedCommand $encoded
```

Expected output:

```text
Sprint28 HUNT001 Test
```

