## Timeline Hunt

The authentication and PowerShell telemetry were combined using:

```spl
index=* (EventCode=4624 OR EventCode=4104)
| eval activity=case(
EventCode=4624 AND LogonType=3,"Network Logon",
EventCode=4104,"PowerShell",
true(),"Other")
| where activity!="Other"
| sort _time
| table _time host EventCode activity TargetUserName IpAddress
```

This allowed the analyst to review post-authentication activity chronologically.

