## Detection Opportunity

HUNT-001 identified an opportunity to detect:

```text
Remote Network Logon
        |
        | Short Time Window
        v
Suspicious PowerShell Execution
```

This candidate was recorded as:

```text
DET-OPP-001 — Remote Network Logon Followed by Suspicious PowerShell
```

The candidate requires separate engineering and validation before promotion to a production detection.

