## Limitations

HUNT-001 has several intentional limitations.

Event ID 4624 with Logon Type 3 establishes network authentication but does not independently establish malicious remote access.

Event ID 4104 identifies PowerShell script activity but does not independently establish malicious execution.

Scheduled-task telemetry has demonstrated inconsistent historical availability within the lab.

The hunt therefore requires analyst context and should not treat individual matching events as proof of compromise.

